    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This staff served a master of the dark arts in Dol Guldur, channeling formidable powers from its blackened wood. To hold it is to command the very fabric of arcane mystery, allowing for feats of magic that few others could ever hope to achieve."
